Spec: Android pending registration client SDK

Purpose:
  Bind a signature-pinned Broker and expose bounded negotiation, pending registration and explicit operation lookup.

Owns:
  ./build.gradle
  ./README.md
  ./src/main/AndroidManifest.xml

References:
  /docs/adr/0006-android-client.md
  /docs/adr/0008-android-pending-sdk.md
  /contracts/java/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/SecureReply.sdd

Must not:
  Depend on the Broker application, registration-core, platform database implementations, FRP, pairing files or network permissions.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Build signature-pinned Binder negotiation and verify portable policy and resource bounds.
  [x] #2 Verify pending registration, operation lookup and uncertain-outcome handling without automatic replay.

Done when:
  AAR and JVM checks pass; evidence distinguishes native Agent acceptance from unexecuted signing-rotation, reinstall and work-profile scenarios.
